28:48.880 --> 28:49.880
Sekarang,

28:49.940 --> 28:52.940
Cik Zhen dah berjaya dan jadi terkenal.

28:53.510 --> 28:54.910
Lelaki perlu beristeri,

28:55.550 --> 28:57.080
